      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Upload the first image and edit PROMPT 1, 2, 3. Queue once.\nOne shared diffusion loader, text encoder loader, video VAE and audio VAE; the scheduler and sampler selection are shared too.\nSegment 1 starts from the image. Segments 2/3 use the previous raw sampled state's last 22 frames, including audio context.\nThe generated overlap is removed once. Three original segment videos/states and the assembled output are saved automatically.\nAll sampling finishes before output decoding. Shared loaders avoid duplicate graph loads; ComfyUI can still move models between RAM and VRAM.\nNative timing: 243 + (260-22) + (260-22) = 719 frames. Final export repeats ONLY the final frame once and pads audio to reach 720 frames / 30 seconds. Masters remain unmodified.\nChanging durations changes the total; pad_final_frame always adds exactly one frame.\nRequires the updated CRTP optional decode/assembly inputs. No refinement or seam smoothing. A continuous shot is prompted, not guaranteed by concatenation."
      ]
    },
